### Test Request Throttling - Selective Implementation
### This tests the selective throttling that only applies to routes with Aptos blockchain operations

### Test 1: Non-throttled routes (should work normally)
###
GET {{u}}/health
###
GET {{u}}/
###
POST {{u}}/debug
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "test": "non-throttled",
  "timestamp": "{{$timestamp}}"
}

### Test 2: Throttled routes - Authentication (should be throttled)
### Run these requests simultaneously to test throttling
###
POST {{u}}/authenticate/options
Content-Type: application/json
X-Request-ID: auth-1

{
  "payload": {"attempt_id": "test-1"},
  "public_key": "0x1234567890abcdef"
}
###
POST {{u}}/authenticate/options
Content-Type: application/json
X-Request-ID: auth-2

{
  "payload": {"attempt_id": "test-2"},
  "public_key": "0x1234567890abcdef"
}
###
POST {{u}}/authenticate/options
Content-Type: application/json
X-Request-ID: auth-3

{
  "payload": {"attempt_id": "test-3"},
  "public_key": "0x1234567890abcdef"
}

